<% layout("/layouts/boilerplate") %>

<div class="row mt-5">
  <div class="col-8 offset-2">
    <h2>Privacy Policy</h2>

    <p class="mt-4">
      At StayNest, we respect your privacy and are committed to protecting
      your personal information.
    </p>

    <h4 class="mt-4">Information We Collect</h4>

    <p>
      We may collect information you provide while creating an account,
      publishing a listing, uploading an image, or submitting a review.
    </p>

    <h4 class="mt-4">How We Use Your Information</h4>

    <p>
      Your information is used to operate the platform, show your listings,
      improve our services, and maintain account security.
    </p>

    <h4 class="mt-4">Your Data</h4>

    <p>
      We do not sell your personal information. Listing details and reviews
      that you publish may be visible to other StayNest users.
    </p>

    <h4 class="mt-4">Contact</h4>

    <p>
      If you have questions about this Privacy Policy, please contact the
      StayNest support team.
    </p>
  </div>
</div>